---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <h1 id="home-title">John Company: Second Edition</h1>
    <p>
      An unofficial browser edition of Cole Wehrle's game. Play at one table, or take your turns
      and pass the save file to whoever acts next.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/play/">Play</a>
      <a class="button" href="/how-to-play/">How to play</a>
      <a class="button" href="/credits/">Credits</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>What works today</h2>
  <p>
    The game is still being built. A 1710 game can be set up and stepped through, but many phases
    are not yet enforced. Expect save files from early versions to stop loading as the rules are
    filled in.
  </p>
</SiteLayout>
